			<div class="content" id="post-content-1297097">
									

<p>Midnight and I thank you. And ideally, you shouldn't have to recognize the characters to enjoy the story. The difference between a cameo and a crutch should be readily apparent.</p>
<p>Midnight's an old character of mine (technically an NPC when I started with her many moons ago) that I re-purposed for the Library. Not the same, but they had different story arcs. I do like her and her feline ways. Trying to think and act like a housecat is one of those things that stretches the mind.</p>

